==Description==
The '''Scarecrow''' was a fast enemy that appeared in the first and second acts of the [[Lunar Overture Event]]. It had higher health and was faster than every enemy that appeared before it. In the [[The Haunted Past|second act]], it would sometimes spawn as a [[Hidden (Attribute)|Hidden]] enemy.

==Appearance==
The '''Scarecrow''' took the appearance of a scarecrow. It was made out of orange straw. It wore a torn purple shirt and hat, which had brown patches on them. On its back, it had a wooden cross. It also had a black carved smile on its face. 

==Strategy==
*Cheap towers with high DPS, such as the [[Ace Pilot]], [[Militant]] or [[Golden Scout]] can be very useful against it.
*Area of effect towers, such as the [[Golden Pyromancer]], [[Pyromancer]] and [[Executioner]], are effective against the '''Scarecrow''' as it spawns in hordes.
*In later waves in the second act, this enemy spawns as hidden. However, by that point you should have high DPS towers with hidden detection, making them quite easy to kill.

